OL,3,GNEWSA'Art helped us understand our
OL,4,Agrief,' say young people experiencing
OL,5,Aloss
OL,6,
OL,7,FTeenagers who have experienced loss
OL,8,Fhave said creating art and talking to
OL,9,Fother young people has helped them
OL,10,Fprocess grief.
OL,12,FNiamh, who is 17 and a pupil at St
OL,13,FPatrick's High School in Keady, County
OL,14,FArmagh, lost her mother a few years
OL,15,Fago.
OL,17,FShe is one of about 100 school children
OL,18,Fwho took part a project to help them
OL,19,Fdeal with bereavement and loss.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
