OL,3,GNEWSA'Art helped us understand our
OL,4,Agrief,' say young people experiencing
OL,5,Aloss
OL,6,
OL,7,FThrough storytelling and art, young
OL,8,Fpeople are encouraged to think about
OL,9,Fsigns of grief with fellow pupils and
OL,10,Fare offered ways to cope with their
OL,11,Ffeelings and experiences.
